     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2023学年绍兴一中教科节活动方案</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>一、指导思想</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在深入贯彻国务院办公厅《关于新时代推进普通高中育人方式改革的指导意见》、教育部《关于做好普通高中新课程新教材实施工作的指导意见》等文件的背景下，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">结合浙江省教育厅《关于推进山区26县和海岛县县域高中结对帮扶工作的实施方案》、绍兴市教育教学研究院《关于开展市直学校教师专业阅读研训活动的通知》要求，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">提升我校教师课堂教学能力、解题命题能力，扎实推进拔尖创新人才培养任务，推动教学研究的科学性、指导性和实效性，特举办本次教科节活动。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>二、活动内容</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本次教科节活动将重点开展</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学科组同课异构联合教研、基于专业阅读的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">课堂教学比武和学科命题</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">比赛3项活动</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同时，为了打造我校教科</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">节</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">品牌，加强兄弟学校的交流学习，本次教科节活动</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">将与</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">杭州二中、温州中学、金华一中、衢州二中</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仙居中学</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等联合</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">开展。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>三、具体安排</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（一）</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>学科组同课异构联合教研</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">工作要求</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教研</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">组与仙居中学</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">至少</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">开展</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1次线下</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同课异构教研活动</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各教研组与仙居中学建立常态化联合教研机制，本学期开展不少于3次</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">联合教研活动</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">. 处室分工</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教研组联系沟通仙居中学教研组，确定基本的活动时间和参加人员</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，上报教科室</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教科室负责统筹和协调同课异构教研活动。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教学处负责课务安排和确保教学秩序。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">信息处负责</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为在我校的同课异构活动</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">录制课堂教学录像</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">. 基本流程</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4月</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日，教科室公布教科节活动方案。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4月</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">12</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日前，各教研组确定</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">至少3次的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同课异构联合教研活动时间和参加人员</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，并上报教科室</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月至6月</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">初</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，各教研组与仙居中学对应学科组开展同课异构教研活动</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">做好拍照，活动记录等</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（二）</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>基于专业阅读的课堂教学比武</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1. </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">参加人员</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校级课堂教学比武分文科组（包括语文、英语、政治、历史、地理、体艺、综合等学科）、理科组（包括数学、物理、化学、生物、技术等学科）两大组进行。语文、英语、数学、物理、化学教研组各推荐2人，其余教研组各推荐1</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">~</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2人。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">其中，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">工作5年内教师必须参加，名单另行通知</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">比赛</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">要求</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">参加比武教师根据本年度专业阅读书目《深度学习》中的相关理论开展教学设计，进行课堂教学展示；学术委员会成员听课、评课。比武期间教研组集体听课、磨课。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">参赛教师根据要求提交录像</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">课视频</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">40分钟，一镜到底，可中、近镜插入，图像清晰流畅，需体现录像的真实性及主讲者信息技术资源运用水平，容量压缩在1G以内</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和3分钟课后反思视频</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（需要另录）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，附加上课PPT及教学设计文案。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.</span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">评奖说明</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">录像课将分文理科进行评比，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">获得</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校内一等奖教师</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">录像课</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">将</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">优先</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">推送至研究院进行专业阅读</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">录像</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">课评比</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">35周岁以下）和</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">参加</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">专业阅读讲座评比</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">评奖方式：设一等奖、二等奖，颁发获奖证书，并开具开课证明。一等奖不超过文科组或理科组内实际参赛人数的40%。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>三</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>）学科命题比赛</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本年度教科节学科命题比赛将与五校联盟校际命题赛相结合，具体安排根据五校联盟相关活动安排另行通知。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">                                                             教科室</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2024年4月</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman", "serif"; font-size: 10.5pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">7</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
